# Tour level The Castro (data/tour.json), a 2-minute run from Harvey Milk Plaza: its three goals, the
# tape and S-K-A-T-E, each set up with a teleport (the riding between spots is left out).
# - Ollie the whole Muni stairs from the plaza: HARVEY MILK SET (the tape hung over these stairs until
#   phase 28; now it does not come with this ollie).
# - A full ollie onto the middle stairs rail and a 50-50 to the bottom: 16 m, All the Way Down
#   (the goal counts 15 m in one grind, while it is still going).
# - Pushing down Castro from Market: 34 km/h past 18th's approach, Bomb Castro St (A, T, E on the way).
# - Castro and 18th: kickflip, manual, heelflip on the rainbow crossing: 1,179, Rainbow Combo.
# - Letters S on the plaza and K down Market; rolling on down Market it leaves the level's area:
#   the wrong-way hint, and the run carries on.
# - Back on the middle stairs rail, ollie held through the 50-50 and popped 0.16 s before its end:
#   the tape, in the air past the bottom of the rail (phase 28: a find). The extra combo takes the run
#   past Pro.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level castro
cmd 10 teleport -591.0 -29.7 19.27 238.3
cmd 12 set skater.vel.x -5.1049
cmd 12 set skater.vel.y -3.1528
hold ollie 116..136
cmd 700 teleport -590.525 -30.458 19.500 -121.69
cmd 702 set skater.vel.x -4.2543
cmd 702 set skater.vel.y -2.6270
hold ollie 767..797
tap grind 804
tap grind 810
tap grind 816
tap grind 822
tap grind 828
tap grind 834
tap grind 840
tap grind 846
tap grind 852
cmd 1500 teleport -572 -55 16.9 176.5
hold up 1510..3900
cmd 4200 teleport -562.5 -260 10.7 355.6
cmd 4230 set skater.vel.x -0.31
cmd 4230 set skater.vel.y 4.5
hold ollie 4240..4260
tap flip+left 4266
tap up 4358
tap down 4363
hold ollie 4458..4478
tap flip+right 4484
cmd 5000 teleport -589 -34.5 18.8 122
hold up 5010..5190
cmd 5400 teleport -578 -7 18.6 30.5
hold up 5410..5600
cmd 8000 teleport -590.525 -30.458 19.500 -121.69
cmd 8002 set skater.vel.x -4.2543
cmd 8002 set skater.vel.y -2.6270
hold ollie 8067..8097
tap grind 8104..8152 every 6
hold ollie 8300..8394
bot balance
run 14700
expect event levelStart{level=castro,seconds=120} within 0..2
expect no event tapeFound within 0..7999
expect event tapeFound{level=castro} within 8426..8430
expect event gap{id=harvey_set} within 296..300
expect event levelGoal{level=castro,id=munirail,name=All the Way Down} within 1097..1101
expect event grindEnd{trick=FS 50-50,reason=end} within 1112..1116
expect event letter{letter=A,have=__A__} within 1930..1934
expect event levelGoal{level=castro,id=castrobomb,name=Bomb Castro St} within 2343..2347
expect event letter{letter=T,have=__AT_} within 2508..2512
expect event letter{letter=E,have=__ATE} within 3250..3254
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Manual + Heelflip,points=1179} within 4591..4595
expect event levelGoal{level=castro,id=rainbow,name=Rainbow Combo} within 4591..4595
expect event letter{letter=S,have=S_ATE} within 5150..5154
expect event letter{letter=K,have=SKATE} within 5600..5604
expect event levelGoal{level=castro,id=skate} within 5600..5604
expect event levelWrongWay{level=castro} within 7386..7390
expect event gap{id=muni_rail} count == 2
expect event levelGoal{level=castro,id=pro,name=Pro Score} within 8552..8556
expect event levelOver{level=castro,score=6459,tape=true} within 14399..14402
expect session.levelGoals.length == 6 at end
expect no event bail
